    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #ECE9E3;border-radius:16px;"><tbody><tr>
        <td style="padding:26px 24px;">
          <p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#00B67A;margin:0 0 10px;">one question</p><h1 style="font-family:'Sanchez', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-weight:400;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 14px;">Has anyone been in touch?</h1><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Hi Maya, your profile went to <b style="color:#2A2521;font-weight:600;">Lumora</b> for the Senior Content Designer role. Has anybody from there contacted you yet?</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">If the answer is no, that is the normal answer this early and it is not a sign of anything. Hiring is slow in a way that has nothing to do with you. Sit tight.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">If they do get in touch, at any point, I would like to know. A line is plenty.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">I am asking because I genuinely cannot see it. I am not a job board. There is no tracker, no dashboard, and nobody feeding me updates from the inside. What I have is what you tell me, and I would rather ask you than guess.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">If you would rather not, that is completely fine and I will not ask again.</p><div style="border-top:1px solid #ECE9E3;margin:26px 0 0;padding:20px 0 0;"></div>
          <div style="margin:24px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #ECE9E3;padding:16px 0 0;">
