    </tr><tr>
      <td style="width:16px;vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 9px;"><div style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#00B67A;margin-top:8px;"></div></td>
      <td style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A453E;padding:0 0 9px;">Your pay floor, and anything you won't accept</td>
    </tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Or send a file instead, whichever is quickest. Any <b style="color:#2A2521;font-weight:600;">one</b> of these works:</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:2px 0 14px;"><tbody><tr>
