    </tr><tr>
      <td style="width:16px;vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 9px;"><div style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#00B67A;margin-top:8px;"></div></td>
      <td style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A453E;padding:0 0 9px;">Your Peerlist profile, exported as Markdown.</td>
    </tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Then I'll start watching your market, and write to you when a role is genuinely worth your time. I'll be honest about where you fit and where you don't.</p>
          <div style="margin:24px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #ECE9E3;padding:16px 0 0;">
    <img src="https://example.com/charlie-hand.png" width="26" height="26" alt="Charlie" style="display:block;">
    <p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#7A7268;margin:6px 0 0;">Your personal career agent</p>
  </div>
        </td>
      </tr></tbody></table>
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;"><tbody><tr>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:20px 0 0;">
      <a href="https://test.charlie.local/unsubscribe?e=a%40b.com&amp;t=YUBiLmNvbQ.X5w3mqkoyLaqDgAqg-Cp2ycbq1rLRWpnf8CM-eLrL6k" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#AAA298;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a>
    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
</body>
</html>",
  "subject": "A few lines about you is enough",
  "text": "Hi Maya, I'm Charlie. Thanks for writing.

You don't need a resume to start. Tell me about yourself in your own words instead. A few lines is plenty: what you've worked on, the kind of role you want, remote, a city, or either, your pay floor, and anything you won't accept.

Or send a file instead, whichever is quickest. Any ONE of these works: your resume, if it's current (PDF or Word); your LinkedIn as a PDF (on your profile, open Resources, then Save to PDF, about ten seconds); or your Peerlist profile exported as Markdown.

Then I'll start watching your market, and write to you when a role is genuinely worth your time. I'll be honest about where you fit and where you don't.

Charlie",
}
`;

exports[`lifecycle emails (email-kit.mjs) > renderOutOfMarket 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
