<title>A straight answer on where I can help</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2A2521;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;">
  <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">I only cover India and the US right now. Rather than send you roles you can't take, here's the honest version.</div>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#FFFFFF;"><tbody><tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:30px 16px 50px;">
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;"><tbody><tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:0 0 18px;">
      <img src="https://example.com/charlie-hand.png" width="34" height="34" alt="Charlie" style="display:inline-block;">
    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #ECE9E3;border-radius:16px;"><tbody><tr>
        <td style="padding:26px 24px;">
          <h1 style="font-family:'Sanchez', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-weight:400;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 14px;">A straight answer on where I can help.</h1><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Hi Lena, thanks for trying me out. I want to be upfront: right now I only cover jobs in India and the US. It looks like you're in Lisbon, and I'd rather tell you that than keep sending you roles you can't actually take.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">So I'm going to hold off, instead of filling your inbox with the wrong thing. It isn't about you, it's the edge of where I can look today.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">If I've got your location wrong, just reply and tell me where you're based, and I'll pick right back up. And if I reach your market later, I'll come find you.</p>
          <div style="margin:24px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #ECE9E3;padding:16px 0 0;">
    <img src="https://example.com/charlie-hand.png" width="26" height="26" alt="Charlie" style="display:block;">
    <p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#7A7268;margin:6px 0 0;">Your personal career agent</p>
  </div>
        </td>
      </tr></tbody></table>
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;"><tbody><tr>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:20px 0 0;">
      <a href="https://test.charlie.local/unsubscribe?e=a%40b.com&amp;t=YUBiLmNvbQ.X5w3mqkoyLaqDgAqg-Cp2ycbq1rLRWpnf8CM-eLrL6k" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#AAA298;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a>
    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
</body>
</html>",
  "subject": "A straight answer on where I can help",
  "text": "Hi Lena, thanks for trying me out. I want to be upfront: right now I only cover jobs in India and the US. It looks like you're in Lisbon, and I'd rather tell you that than keep sending you roles you can't actually take.

So I'm going to hold off, instead of filling your inbox with the wrong thing. It isn't about you, it's the edge of where I can look today.

If I've got your location wrong, just reply and tell me where you're based, and I'll pick right back up. And if I reach your market later, I'll come find you.

Charlie",
}
`;

