      <td style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A453E;padding:0 0 9px;">Your pay floor, and anything you won't accept</td>
