  "subject": "You're all set, I'm on it",
  "text": "You're all set, Maya. I've read your background, and "the Lumen design system" is exactly the kind of thing I'll lead with, and I know what to look for.

Every Monday I read every live posting across more than 1,000 companies. If something clears your bar, that's when you'll hear from me. If nothing does, I stay quiet, and that's the point.

Every email gives you one role at a time, why it fits, gaps and all, and how to position yourself for it.

One quick thing before I go deep: what's your pay floor? Just reply, that's the whole reply.

This stays a conversation. Change what you're after any time, just reply. And if you've got more that shows your work, a deck, a case study, a writeup, send it over and I'll fold it into what I look for.

Charlie",
}
`;

