        <td style="padding:26px 24px;">
          <p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#00B67A;margin:0 0 10px;">what I found</p><h1 style="font-family:'Sanchez', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-weight:400;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 14px;">3 roles, and the honest reason on each.</h1><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Hi Maya, you are a lead product manager, so I aimed at product roles in and around your city and anything genuinely remote.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#F6F5F2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 12px;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:15px 16px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Sanchez', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#2A2521;">Product Manager &middot; PhonePe</div>
        <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#7A7268;margin:2px 0 0;">Bengaluru, Karnataka</div><div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A453E;margin:8px 0 0;">600 million users, 40 million merchants.</div><div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#00805A;margin:6px 0 0;">Nothing in the way of this one.</div>
        <div><a href="https://example.test/phonepe" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;background:#00805A;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;margin:12px 0 0;">See the role &rarr;</a></div>
      </td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#F6F5F2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 12px;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:15px 16px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Sanchez', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#2A2521;">Principal Product Manager, Firefly &middot; Adobe</div>
        <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#7A7268;margin:2px 0 0;">Noida, India</div><div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A453E;margin:8px 0 0;">Generative AI surfaces, image and video. The most senior of the four.</div><div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#7A7268;margin:6px 0 0;">Why I held it: you told me you want remote, and this one is in Noida. If you would consider it, say so and I will stop filtering those out.</div>
