      </td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#F6F5F2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 12px;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:15px 16px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Sanchez', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#2A2521;">Product Manager, Marketplace &middot; Supabase</div>
        <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#7A7268;margin:2px 0 0;">Remote</div><div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A453E;margin:8px 0 0;">Open source Postgres platform, 7 million developers.</div><div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#7A7268;margin:6px 0 0;">Why I held it: it asks for platform and marketplace depth I cannot see in your profile yet.</div>
        <div><a href="https://example.test/supabase" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;background:#00805A;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;margin:12px 0 0;">See the role &rarr;</a></div>
      </td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Some of these ask for depth I cannot see in your profile yet. Not because it is not there. Because all I have is where you have worked and for how long, not what you actually owned. Three or four lines would change that: what you own now and how big the team is, one thing you shipped that mattered and what changed because of it, and the same for an earlier role if you feel like it.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">You do not need to write a resume for me. On LinkedIn, open your profile, click More, then Save to PDF, and send me that file. I can read it.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">If any of that is wrong, tell me. If you would consider something I have been filtering out, tell me that too and I will stop filtering it.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Just reply here.</p>
          <div style="margin:24px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #ECE9E3;padding:16px 0 0;">
    <img src="https://example.com/charlie-hand.png" width="26" height="26" alt="Charlie" style="display:block;">
    <p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#7A7268;margin:6px 0 0;">Your personal career agent</p>
  </div>
        </td>
      </tr></tbody></table>
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;"><tbody><tr>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:20px 0 0;">
      <a href="https://test.charlie.local/unsubscribe?e=a%40b.com&amp;t=YUBiLmNvbQ.X5w3mqkoyLaqDgAqg-Cp2ycbq1rLRWpnf8CM-eLrL6k" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#AAA298;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a>
    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
</body>
</html>"
`;

exports[`role email (render-email.mjs) > ROLE_RARE — Edge Engine rare-find variant (plum label + opening frame, no attach note) 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
<title>Senior Product Designer @ Klaviyo</title>
<style>
  /* Fluid on phones: fill the screen at true font size instead of scaling the whole 600px down. */
  @media only screen and (max-width:600px){
    .container{width:100%!important;}
    .wrap{padding:14px 8px 34px!important;}
    .gp{padding-left:20px!important;padding-right:20px!important;}
    .foot{padding-left:20px!important;padding-right:20px!important;}
    /* responsive type, job mail only: shrink the big title so it does not overflow, and lift
       the smallest labels/body so they stay comfortably readable on a phone */
    .e-role{font-size:26px!important;line-height:1.2!important;}
    .e-where{font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.5!important;}
    .e-kick,.e-lbl{font-size:11.5px!important;}
    .e-body{font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.5!important;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#F5F3F0;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#494540;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;">
  <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">You took Lumen from zero to adopted across every surface, which is the exact scope this role opens with, and y charlieroles</div>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#F5F3F0;"><tbody><tr>
    <td align="center" class="wrap" style="padding:24px 12px 44px;">
      <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="container" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e1dacd;border-radius:8px;"><tbody>
        <tr><td class="gp" style="padding:16px 40px;"><img src="https://example.com/charlie-hand.png" width="30" height="30" alt="Charlie" style="display:block;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td class="gp" style="padding:24px 40px 20px;">
    <div style="margin:0 0 12px;"><span style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;color:#ffffff;background:#6B4E9E;border-radius:100px;padding:4px 12px;white-space:nowrap;">Rare find</span></div>
    
    <div class="e-role" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:29px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#1b1710;">Senior Product Designer</div>
    <div class="e-where" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;margin-top:12px;">Klaviyo <span style="color:#9a9082;">&middot;</span> Boston, MA <span style="color:#9a9082;">&middot;</span> Design Systems</div></td></tr><tr><td class="gp" style="padding:20px 40px 20px;"><div class="e-body" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#1b1710;">Most designers who apply here show one side of the job. You show both: the systems depth from taking Lumen from zero to adopted, and the zero to one product judgment. This is a role your specific mix is rare for.</div></td></tr><tr><td class="gp" style="padding:20px 40px 20px;"><div class="e-lbl" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1b1710;margin:0 0 12px;">The job</div><div class="e-body" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;">Klaviyo is looking for a senior product designer to evolve Ascent, their internal design system, by owning components, tokens, patterns, and documentation across product surfaces.</div><div style="margin-top:16px;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;">2 days ago<span style="display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;line-height:11px;text-align:center;background:#00805A;border-radius:50%;color:#fff;font-size:7px;font-weight:500;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:6px;">&#10003;</span> <span style="color:#9a9082;">&middot;</span> <span style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#00654A;background:#E8F8F1;border-radius:100px;padding:6px 14px;vertical-align:middle;"><span style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;">$170k&ndash;$205k</span> &middot; above avg</span></div></td></tr><tr><td class="gp" style="padding:20px 40px 20px;"><div class="e-lbl" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1b1710;margin:0 0 12px;">Your angle on this one</div><div style="background:#FAFAF8;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 18px;">
      <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;margin:0 0 10px;">Open with the Lumen design system you took from zero to adopted.</div>
      <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tbody><tr><td width="16" style="vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 8px;"><div style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#00B67A;margin-top:8px;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;">&nbsp;</div></td><td style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;padding:0 0 8px;">the Lumen design system you took from zero to adopted.</td></tr><tr><td width="16" style="vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 8px;"><div style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#00B67A;margin-top:8px;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;">&nbsp;</div></td><td style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;padding:0 0 8px;">Your 0 to 1 dashboard work, framed as product judgment.</td></tr></tbody></table>
      
    </div></td></tr><tr><td class="gp" style="padding:20px 40px 20px;"><div class="e-lbl" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1b1710;margin:0 0 12px;">One person who might be able to refer you</div>
      <div style="border:1px solid #eae4d9;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 18px;">
      <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tbody><tr>
        <td width="46" style="vertical-align:middle;"><div style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:#00805A;color:#fff;text-align:center;line-height:40px;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;">JL</div></td>
        <td style="vertical-align:middle;padding-left:12px;">
          <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#1b1710;">Jordan Lee</div>
          <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#494540;margin-top:1px;">Staff Product Designer, Klaviyo</div>
          <div style="margin-top:6px;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jordan-lee-example" style="color:#00805A;text-decoration:none;">LinkedIn</a> <span style="color:#9a9082;">&middot;</span> <a href="mailto:z@k.com" style="color:#00805A;text-decoration:none;">Reach out</a></div>
        </td>
      </tr></tbody></table>
    </div></td></tr><tr><td class="gp" style="padding:20px 40px 20px;">
      <div class="e-lbl" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1b1710;margin:0 0 12px;">About Klaviyo</div>
      <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:500;color:#1b1710;margin:0 0 8px;">Klaviyo<span style="display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;line-height:14px;text-align:center;background:#00805A;border-radius:50%;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:500;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:6px;">&#10003;</span></div>
      <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;margin:0 0 16px;">Marketing automation and CRM for e-commerce brands.</div>
      <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;border:1px solid #eae4d9;border-radius:8px;border-collapse:separate;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:12px 20px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;">
        <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#494540;">Stage</div>
        <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:#494540;margin-top:4px;">Public</div>
      </td><td style="padding:12px 20px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;">
        <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#494540;">Raised</div>
        <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:#494540;margin-top:4px;">~$778M</div>
      </td><td style="padding:12px 20px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;">
        <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#494540;">Team</div>
        <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:#494540;margin-top:4px;">~2,368 people<div style="margin-top:8px;"><span style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;color:#00654A;background:#E8F8F1;border-radius:100px;padding:4px 12px;white-space:nowrap;">68 open roles &middot; up 31%</span></div></div>
      </td></tr></tbody></table>
      <div style="margin-top:16px;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;color:#494540;"><a href="https://www.glassdoor.com/Search/results.htm?keyword=Klaviyo" style="color:#494540;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2.5px;text-decoration-color:#9a9082;">See employee reviews on Glassdoor &rarr;</a></div></td></tr><tr><td class="gp" style="padding:20px 40px 20px;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://test.charlie.local/e/eyJlIjoiYUBiLmNvbSIsImYiOiJhQGIuY29tOmpvYjEiLCJ2IjoiYXBwbHlfY2xpY2siLCJ1IjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9leGFtcGxlLmNvbS9hcHBseSJ9.51rT4be5hl2c21xWbMOnteL6gLfZrwnFkHR_lKa86fc" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:#ffffff;background:#1b1710;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 30px;border-radius:7px;">Apply at Klaviyo &rarr;</a></td></tr></tbody></table><div style="margin-top:16px;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;color:#494540;"><a href="mailto:start@mail.example.com?subject=Update%20my%20preferences" target="_blank" style="color:#494540;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2.5px;text-decoration-color:#9a9082;">Update my profile</a></div><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:32px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#9a9082;margin:0 0 12px;">Was this a good match for you?</div>
        <a href="https://test.charlie.local/e/eyJlIjoiYUBiLmNvbSIsImYiOiJhQGIuY29tOmpvYjEiLCJ2Ijoid29ydGgifQ.sNei3ljXxNNZbxKVURbVlAnuX0MIZbKWBbI6IbYDRqI" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:#494540;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #eae4d9;border-radius:100px;padding:8px 16px;margin:0 4px;">&#8593;&nbsp; Worth my time</a>
        <a href="https://test.charlie.local/e/eyJlIjoiYUBiLmNvbSIsImYiOiJhQGIuY29tOmpvYjEiLCJ2Ijoibm90In0.6x7T06kVawZb69dJLCxxE7IVw_kqX4wcLmBW7WqzYVk" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:#494540;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #eae4d9;border-radius:100px;padding:8px 16px;margin:0 4px;">&#8595;&nbsp; Not for me</a>
      </div></td></tr>
      </tbody></table>
      <div class="foot" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#9a9082;max-width:600px;margin:18px auto 0;padding:0 40px;text-align:center;">
        <a href="https://test.charlie.local/unsub" style="color:#9a9082;">Unsubscribe</a>
      </div>
    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
</body>
</html>
"
`;

exports[`role email (render-email.mjs) > ROLE_THIN — thin/India role (prose fallback, US blocks hidden) 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
<title>Product Designer @ Zluri</title>
<style>
  /* Fluid on phones: fill the screen at true font size instead of scaling the whole 600px down. */
  @media only screen and (max-width:600px){
    .container{width:100%!important;}
    .wrap{padding:14px 8px 34px!important;}
    .gp{padding-left:20px!important;padding-right:20px!important;}
    .foot{padding-left:20px!important;padding-right:20px!important;}
    /* responsive type, job mail only: shrink the big title so it does not overflow, and lift
       the smallest labels/body so they stay comfortably readable on a phone */
    .e-role{font-size:26px!important;line-height:1.2!important;}
    .e-where{font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.5!important;}
    .e-kick,.e-lbl{font-size:11.5px!important;}
    .e-body{font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.5!important;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#F5F3F0;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#494540;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;">
  <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">Your systems work maps cleanly to their design-debt problem. charlieroles</div>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#F5F3F0;"><tbody><tr>
    <td align="center" class="wrap" style="padding:24px 12px 44px;">
      <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="container" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e1dacd;border-radius:8px;"><tbody>
        <tr><td class="gp" style="padding:16px 40px;"><img src="https://example.com/charlie-hand.png" width="30" height="30" alt="Charlie" style="display:block;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td class="gp" style="padding:24px 40px 20px;">
    <div style="margin:0 0 12px;"><span style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;color:#ffffff;background:#00805A;border-radius:100px;padding:4px 12px;white-space:nowrap;">Fresh pick</span></div>
    
    <div class="e-role" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:29px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#1b1710;">Product Designer</div>
