ns-serif;font-size:13.5px;color:#494540;"><a href="mailto:start@mail.example.com?subject=Update%20my%20preferences" target="_blank" style="color:#494540;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2.5px;text-decoration-color:#9a9082;">Update my profile</a></div><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:32px;">
