        <tr><td class="gp" style="padding:16px 40px;"><img src="https://example.com/charlie-hand.png" width="30" height="30" alt="Charlie" style="display:block;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td class="gp" style="padding:24px 40px 20px;">
    <div style="margin:0 0 12px;"><span style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;color:#ffffff;background:#00805A;border-radius:100px;padding:4px 12px;white-space:nowrap;">Today's pick</span></div>
    
    <div class="e-role" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:29px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#1b1710;">Senior Product Designer</div>
    <div class="e-where" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;margin-top:12px;">Klaviyo <span style="color:#9a9082;">&middot;</span> Boston, MA <span style="color:#9a9082;">&middot;</span> Design Systems</div></td></tr><tr><td class="gp" style="padding:20px 40px 20px;"><div class="e-lbl" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1b1710;margin:0 0 12px;">The job</div><div class="e-body" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;">Klaviyo is looking for a senior product designer to evolve Ascent, their internal design system, by owning components, tokens, patterns, and documentation across product surfaces.</div><div style="margin-top:16px;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;">2 days ago<span style="display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;line-height:11px;text-align:center;background:#00805A;border-radius:50%;color:#fff;font-size:7px;font-weight:500;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:6px;">&#10003;</span> <span style="color:#9a9082;">&middot;</span> <span style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#00654A;background:#E8F8F1;border-radius:100px;padding:6px 14px;vertical-align:middle;"><span style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;">$170k&ndash;$205k</span> &middot; above avg</span></div></td></tr><tr><td class="gp" style="padding:20px 40px 20px;"><div class="e-lbl" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1b1710;margin:0 0 12px;">Your angle on this one</div><div style="background:#FAFAF8;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 18px;">
      <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;margin:0 0 10px;">Open with the Lumen design system you took from zero to adopted.</div>
      <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tbody><tr><td width="16" style="vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 8px;"><div style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#00B67A;margin-top:8px;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;">&nbsp;</div></td><td style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;padding:0 0 8px;">the Lumen design system you took from zero to adopted.</td></tr><tr><td width="16" style="vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 8px;"><div style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#00B67A;margin-top:8px;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;">&nbsp;</div></td><td style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#494540;padding:0 0 8px;">Your 0 to 1 dashboard work, framed as product judgment.</td></tr></tbody></table>
      
    </div></td></tr><tr><td class="gp" style="padding:20px 40px 20px;"><div class="e-lbl" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1b1710;margin:0 0 12px;">One person who might be able to refer you</div>
