          <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#494540;margin-top:1px;">Staff Product Designer, Klaviyo</div>
