        </td>
      </tr></tbody></table>
    </div></td></tr><tr><td class="gp" style="padding:20px 40px 20px;">
      <div class="e-lbl" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1b1710;margin:0 0 12px;">About Klaviyo</div>
      <div style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:500;color:#1b1710;margin:0 0 8px;">Klaviyo<span style="display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;line-height:14px;text-align:center;background:#00805A;border-radius:50%;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:500;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:6px;">&#10003;</span></div>
