exports[`the Qualify & Submit sequence > verify 3`] = `
"Hi Asha.

Acme Robotics is hiring for a Support Engineer, Billing role in Jaipur, and I can put you forward through Pieworks. I think you could fit it, and before your name goes anywhere I want to check a few things with you.

Short answers are fine. Just reply to this email:

1. May I put you forward to Acme Robotics for the Support Engineer, Billing role?
2. What is your current pay a year, fixed and variable separately? For example: 12 lakh fixed, 2 lakh variable.
3. What is your notice period, in days?
4. Please attach your latest CV as a PDF.

Nothing about you goes to Acme Robotics unless you say yes to the first question. If it is a no, say so and I won't write about this role again.

Charlie"
`;

exports[`the evidence ask > renderEvidenceAsk 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sanchez&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<title>Send me the evidence</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2A2521;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;">
  <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">Every company asks what you actually did. Right now I cannot answer that for you. charlieevidenceask</div>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#FFFFFF;"><tbody><tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:30px 16px 50px;">
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;"><tbody><tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:0 0 18px;">
      <img src="https://example.com/charlie-hand.png" width="34" height="34" alt="Charlie" style="display:inline-block;">
    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #ECE9E3;border-radius:16px;"><tbody><tr>
        <td style="padding:26px 24px;">
          <p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#00B67A;margin:0 0 10px;">so I have something to say about you</p><h1 style="font-family:'Sanchez', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-weight:400;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 14px;">Send me the evidence.</h1><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Hi Maya, every company I talk to asks the same thing, and it is never your title. It is what you actually did, and how they can tell.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Right now, for you, I do not have that. Without it you are a job title and a number of years, which is what every other name on the pile looks like too. With it I have something to say about you that nobody else can say.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:2px 0 14px;"><tbody><tr>
      <td style="width:16px;vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 9px;"><div style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#00B67A;margin-top:8px;"></div></td>
      <td style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A453E;padding:0 0 9px;">One account you grew, saved, or lost and learned from. Which account, what you did, and what it was worth.</td>
    </tr><tr>
      <td style="width:16px;vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 9px;"><div style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#00B67A;margin-top:8px;"></div></td>
      <td style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A453E;padding:0 0 9px;">What you are expecting on pay.</td>
    </tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Rough is fine. A paragraph you typed once, a link, an old deck, a number you remember. I would rather have it messy than not have it.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">I will not promise this makes anything faster. It makes you legible, and that is the part I can actually do something with.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Nothing with your name on it goes to any company until you tell me it can.</p><div style="border-top:1px solid #ECE9E3;margin:26px 0 0;padding:20px 0 0;"></div>
          <div style="margin:24px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #ECE9E3;padding:16px 0 0;">
    <img src="https://example.com/charlie-hand.png" width="26" height="26" alt="Charlie" style="display:block;">
    <p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#7A7268;margin:6px 0 0;">Your personal career agent</p>
  </div>
        </td>
      </tr></tbody></table>
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;"><tbody><tr>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:20px 0 0;">
      <a href="https://test.charlie.local/unsubscribe?e=a%40b.com&amp;t=YUBiLmNvbQ.X5w3mqkoyLaqDgAqg-Cp2ycbq1rLRWpnf8CM-eLrL6k" style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#AAA298;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a>
    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
    </td>
  </tr></tbody></table>
</body>
</html>",
  "subject": "Send me the evidence",
  "text": "Hi Maya, every company I talk to asks the same thing, and it is never your title. It is what you actually did, and how they can tell.

Right now, for you, I do not have that. Without it you are a job title and a number of years, which is what every other name on the pile looks like too. With it I have something to say about you that nobody else can say.

- One account you grew, saved, or lost and learned from. Which account, what you did, and what it was worth.
- What you are expecting on pay.

Rough is fine. A paragraph you typed once, a link, an old deck, a number you remember. I would rather have it messy than not have it.

I will not promise this makes anything faster. It makes you legible, and that is the part I can actually do something with.

Nothing with your name on it goes to any company until you tell me it can.

Charlie",
}
`;

