  "subject": "A UI/UX Designer role in Kolkata, if you want it",
  "text": "Hi Maya, a agency that designs apps for retail brands is hiring a UI/UX Designer, two to four years, on site in Kolkata.

I am writing to you specifically because your answers walk through how you debugged a live incident step by step, which is the thing this brief actually asks for.

I have not sent them anything about you, and I will not unless you tell me to. That is the whole reason for this email.

If you want me to put you forward, reply and say so. If it is a no, say that instead and I will stop. Either answer is a useful one and neither costs you anything.

I have not named the company because I do not have permission to yet. If you say yes, I will tell you who it is before anything with your name on it moves.

Charlie",
}
`;

