        <td style="padding:26px 24px;">
          <p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#00B67A;margin:0 0 10px;">your yes, and what comes next</p><h1 style="font-family:'Sanchez', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-weight:400;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 14px;">One question before I put you forward.</h1><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Hi.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Thank you for saying yes to the product designer role in Pune.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">The company has been specific about what they need, so I would rather ask you straight than guess from your CV. Short answers are fine, and rough numbers are fine.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;"><b style="color:#2A2521;font-weight:600;">1. Which products have you designed end to end, from discovery to launch?</b></p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">If something here is not something you have done, say so plainly. That is a useful answer, and it is better for both of us than a generous one.</p><p style="font-family:'Avenir Next',Avenir,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A453E;margin:0 0 14px;">Once I have your answers I will tell you straight whether I am putting you forward. If I am, you will know who the company is first, and nothing moves until you say so.</p><div style="border-top:1px solid #ECE9E3;margin:26px 0 0;padding:20px 0 0;"></div>
          <div style="margin:24px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #ECE9E3;padding:16px 0 0;">
