  "subject": "A design lead role in Kolkata, and two questions",
  "text": "Hi Maya, a consultancy that designs apps for its clients is hiring a design lead, and I think it is worth your minute.

What I know: it is in Kolkata, and it is hybrid rather than remote. Seven years or more. The budget goes up to 32 lakhs. The work is design alongside three other things: planning the work, coaching the junior designers, and presenting to clients yourself.

That last part is the real question. It is a consultancy rather than a product company, so you would be in front of clients, not only in front of a product.

I have not named the company because I do not have permission to yet. If it sounds interesting, there are two things I do not know about you:

- Would you work onsite in Kolkata for this? If you are not there now, would you move?
- Does the budget work for you?

Reply and tell me. If it is a no on either, say that too and I will keep looking.

Nothing about you goes to any company until you tell me it can.

Charlie",
}
`;

