  "subject": "One nudge on that Kolkata design lead role",
  "text": "Hi Maya, I wrote a few days ago about a design lead role and did not hear back, which is completely fine. This is the only time I will nudge you about it.

The facts again, in case the first one got buried: a consultancy that designs apps for its clients, in Kolkata, hybrid rather than remote, seven years or more, and the budget goes up to 32 lakhs. The work is design alongside planning the work, coaching the junior designers, and presenting to clients yourself.

If it is interesting, two things I still do not know about you:

- Would you work onsite in Kolkata for this? If you are not there now, would you move?
- Does the budget work for you?

If it is not for you, saying nothing is a complete answer and I will leave this one alone. It does not affect anything else I send you.

Nothing about you goes to any company until you tell me it can.

Charlie",
}
`;

